---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Waitlist from '../components/Waitlist.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config.ts';
---

<Base title="About" path="/about" description="Why PSX Desk exists: honest, plain-English research for Pakistan's markets — accountable by design.">
  <section class="section-tight page-hero">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Honest research for Pakistan’s markets.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Half a million Pakistanis invest on the PSX. Almost none of them have a research tool that
        speaks plainly, shows its working, and admits when it’s wrong. {site.name} is built to be
        that tool.
      </p>

      <h2>The problem we started with</h2>
      <p>
        Research in this market comes in two flavours: raw numbers with no explanation, or confident
        “calls” with no accountability. Beginners drown in the first and get burned by the second.
        We wanted something a first-time investor could actually understand — and a serious one
        could actually trust.
      </p>

      <h2>How we’re different</h2>
      <p>
        Three commitments run through everything. We <strong>explain</strong> — every stock gets a
        plain-English read. We <strong>debate</strong> — analysts argue each name out in the open, bull
        against bear. And we <strong>keep score</strong> — every read is dated and graded over time,
        losses included, with the same yardstick turned on the brokers.
      </p>

      <h2>What we will never do</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is a research and analytics tool, not an adviser and not a broker. It never places
        orders. It never says “buy”. It never promises returns. The decision is always yours — our job
        is to make it a well-informed one.
      </p>

      <div class="about-cta">
        <a href="/plans" class="btn btn-primary">Get started →</a>
        <a href="/features" class="btn btn-ghost">See the features</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-sec">
    <div class="wrap center cta-inner"><Waitlist source="about" /></div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .prose .lead { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .about-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cta-sec { background: var(--bg-tint); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cta-inner :global(.wl) { margin: 0 auto; }
</style>
